<title>HUNGARY: Hungary o/n rates end higher at 25.00/25.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary o/n rates end higher at 25.00/25.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates ended almost two percent higher on Friday in tight money supply, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;After an initial surge to 26.00/26.50 percent the rates retreated to end at around 25.00/25.50 percent,&quot; said Gabor Liener of Unicbank.</p>
<p>On Thursday overnight rates closed at 23.375/23.625 percent.</p>
<p>Traders expected a slow downward movement to start on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
